## Existing branch checks

- Base: `git merge-base --is-ancestor origin/<base> HEAD`.
- Behind: `git rev-list --count HEAD..origin/<base>` → rebase (personal branch) or merge.
- Wrong base → warn and offer to recreate; the user decides.

